+Click the mic and speak. Click again to stop and transcribe the current phrase; `Esc` cancels.
+For continuous recording, completed two-minute chunks are transcribed on the local GPU and
+appended while the next chunk records. You can fix the accumulated text before sending.
+
+Speech is recognized locally. The default backend is
+[faster-whisper](https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper); when the user-local
+[whisper.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp) Vulkan build and a matching GGML model are
+present, it is selected first so AMD GPUs can accelerate transcription. CPU/int8 remains the
+fallback. The background server exits after 10 idle minutes. Logs:
